{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeH3BlockRep","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeH3BlockRep","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeH3AlgebraInstance","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Matrix.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.H3A.blockRep","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.H3A.blockRep","kind":"def","line":145,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3BlockRep.lean#L145-L171","doc":"**The (2,1) two-dimensional block representation (sorry-free).**\nThe algebra homomorphism `H₃(q) →ₐ M₂(K)` induced by the seminormal\nmatrices; with the two characters of `HeckeH3Characters` this\ncompletes the block *data* of\n$H_3(q) \\cong K \\times K \\times M_2(K)$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.blockOf_mulNF","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.blockOf_mulNF","kind":"theorem","line":120,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3BlockRep.lean#L120-L141","doc":"**Multiplicativity of the block map on the full NF product\n(sorry-free)** — expand `mulNF` by right-linearity, reduce each\nbasis-word action with the two intertwiners (the same structured\nroute as `chiNF_mulNF`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.blockOf_mulσ₁","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.blockOf_mulσ₁","kind":"theorem","line":108,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3BlockRep.lean#L108-L118","doc":"The block map intertwines the right `σ₁`-action with right\nmultiplication by $S_1$ (sorry-free). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.blockOf_mulσ₀","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.blockOf_mulσ₀","kind":"theorem","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3BlockRep.lean#L96-L106","doc":"The block map intertwines the right `σ₀`-action with right\nmultiplication by $S_0$ (sorry-free). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.blockOf","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.blockOf","kind":"def","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3BlockRep.lean#L88-L94","doc":"The block map on NF coordinates: each basis word goes to the\ncorresponding word in $S_0, S_1$ (basis\n`[γ, σ₀, σ₁, σ₁σ₀, σ₀σ₁, σ₀σ₁σ₀]`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.S0_S1_braid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.S0_S1_braid","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3BlockRep.lean#L79-L86","doc":"The braid relation $S_0 S_1 S_0 = S_1 S_0 S_1$ (sorry-free). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.S1_hecke","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.S1_hecke","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3BlockRep.lean#L70-L77","doc":"$S_1$ satisfies the Hecke quadratic (sorry-free). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.S0_hecke","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.S0_hecke","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3BlockRep.lean#L60-L68","doc":"$S_0$ satisfies the Hecke quadratic $S^2 = (q - q^{-1})S + 1$\n(sorry-free). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.S1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.S1","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3BlockRep.lean#L54-L58","doc":"The mixing seminormal generator $S_1$ (entries rational in $q$ over\nthe genericity denominator $q^2+1$). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H3.S0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H3.S0","kind":"def","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH3BlockRep.lean#L50-L52","doc":"The diagonal seminormal generator: $S_0 = \\mathrm{diag}(q, -q^{-1})$. ","signatureChunk":0}]}